{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103100","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110310001:2":{"text":"브루투스 님을 상대하려면... 아르사? 이봐, 아르사!","source_cn":"如果要对付布鲁特斯大人——阿尔萨？喂，阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AC58220F60C0C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1110310001":{"text":"브루투스 님을 상대하려면... 아르사? 이봐, 아르사!","source_cn":"如果要对付布鲁特斯大人——阿尔萨？喂，阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AC58220F60C0C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110310002:1":{"text":"또 현실 도피하는 거야? 어서 썩 나오지 못해!","source_cn":"你这家伙又不肯面对现实了吗？给我出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C78EE3702A13351","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110310003:1":{"text":"아, 잡아당기지 마! 소렌, 너 미쳤어? 정말 군신 브루투스와 싸우려는 거야?","source_cn":"别拽我别拽我！索恩，你是疯了吗？你是真的想挑战战神布鲁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0A6FAF538A7FAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110310004:1":{"text":"브루투스가 대검으로 적을 베는 힘을 너도 봤잖아! 그분이 너그러운 마음으로 우릴 살려준다 해도, 우리 둘 중 한 사람에게 장애가 남는다면 누가 우리 부족을 지킬 건데?","source_cn":"你看到他那把大剑砍下来的力道了吧！即使他宽大为怀，留我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FB98F15EAA0BF57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110310005:1":{"text":"그럼 어쩌자는 거야... 전투도 하기 전에 항복이라도 하자는 거야?","source_cn":"你这是什么意思……还没开打，就想着输？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6293F1ACD0050AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110310006:1":{"text":"내가 묻고 싶은 말이야! 설마 이길 거라고 생각하는 건 아니겠지?","source_cn":"我还想问你是什么意思！你莫非觉得你有机会赢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EA01778BF79E2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110310007:1":{"text":"그래서, 지금 도망이라도 가겠다는 거야? 군신과 상대할 기회를 포기하겠다고? 아르사, 아버지와의 약속을 잊었어?","source_cn":"所以，你想临阵脱逃？你想放弃和战神做对手的机会？阿尔萨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA6BD36BB9CC7BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110310008:1":{"text":"아버지가 부족을 우리에게 맡겼으니, 우르 부족의 힘을 사막 전체에 증명해야 해...","source_cn":"老爹将氏族托付给我们，所以，我们要向整片沙漠证明乌尔氏族——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5190993156D7AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110310009:1":{"text":"정신 차려! 우리가 해야 할 일은 우르 부족을 살리는 거야!","source_cn":"你给我清醒点好吗？我们要做的是让乌尔氏族活下来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x307586D272E9CDEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110310010:1":{"text":"살아남으려면 힘을 비축해야 해! 질 게 뻔한 전투는 절대 하지 않을 거라고!","source_cn":"为了活下来，必须保存力量！这种必败的挑战，我绝不会去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6536FB3CA8FAB4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110310011:1":{"text":"겁쟁이...","source_cn":"懦弱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037C65F271E69231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110310012:1":{"text":"그래, 난 겁쟁이지만 이기적인 너보단 나아! 도전만 생각하고 결과 따윈 생각하지도 않잖아!","source_cn":"对，我是懦弱，但也好过你自私！你只想要挑战，从不想后果！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6818645C51561EED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110310013:2":{"text":"전투에서는 무슨 일이든 일어날 수 있어. 반드시 지는 전투란 없는 법이야.","source_cn":"战斗中，什么都可能发生，没有哪场战斗必定会输。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52904F9AFE177FFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110310014:1":{"text":"강자는 도망치지 않아. 약속의 날이 되면, 아르사...","source_cn":"强者不会逃避。到了约定之日，阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CE6B27114877EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110310015:1":{"text":"가든 말든 알아서 해. 나는 참가할 거니까.","source_cn":"随便你去不去。我一个人也会准时赴约的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC5EE0C114DE542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"웅크리고 있어","source_cn":"她团起来了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD241E3F80EA3FF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"웅크리고 있어","female":"웅크리고 있어","variant_male_record_index":"63366","variant_female_record_index":"63367","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"모래 속에 파묻혔어","source_cn":"她埋在沙子里","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE7BC703338E2D82D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"모래 속에 파묻혔어","female":"모래 속에 파묻혔어","variant_male_record_index":"63368","variant_female_record_index":"63369","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}